cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "ocean3d" in publications use:'
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-only
title: 'ocean3d: Three-Dimensional Marine Spatial Analysis'
version: 0.1.1.9008
abstract: Facilitates the analysis of marine habitat in 3D, enabling descriptions
  of habitat by depth and area. Provides tools for volume calculation, environmental
  extraction, and spatial overlap analysis between species ranges, fisheries, and
  depth-stratified environmental data.
